Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:22:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mask): zero-lag temporal smoothing of landmark tracks
 for recorded video

Per-frame landmarks jitter by a few pixels and the wearable shimmers. Recorded video has the
whole track, so a One Euro filter runs forward and backward inside each continuous run (never
across cuts or gaps) and the passes are averaged: ~3 px of still-face jitter drops to ~1 px
while fast head motion keeps its timing.

